[graphic] Evidence Domain: Data privacy and contract readiness (ToS/DPA, data flows,
retention/deletion) | What to Confirm (minimum bar): Data flows documented; ToS/DPA reviewed;
retention/deletion addressed; prohibited uses clarified; contract terms in place
